OL,3,AI used to live in a quiet area - now a
OL,4,Adata centre overlooks my garden
OL,5,
OL,6,FOverlooking the garden of Amanda
OL,7,FYoung's family home is a data centre.
OL,9,F"It used to be a nice, quiet area,"
OL,10,Fsaid Amanda, who lives near to one of
OL,11,Fthe large buildings in Newport.
OL,13,F"But with more data centres coming in,
OL,14,Fwe kind of don't know what they're
OL,15,Fgoing to bring with them."
OL,17,FData centres are buildings full of
OL,18,Fpowerful computers used to run digital
OL,19,Fservices, from online banking to movie
OL,20,Fstreaming.
